### Obtain an access token (REQ-FUNC-007) - not OAuth2, see ADR-0005
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "clientId": "demo-client", "clientSecret": "demo-secret-change-me" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Create an order (REQ-FUNC-005)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "items": [
        { "productId": "SKU-001", "quantity": 3 },
        { "productId": "SKU-003", "quantity": 2 }
    ]
}

> {% client.global.set("orderLocation", response.headers.valueOf("Location")); %}

### Read the order back (REQ-FUNC-006)
GET http://localhost:8080{{orderLocation}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 401 - no token (BR-012)
GET http://localhost:8080{{orderLocation}}

### 400 - quantity must be positive (REQ-FUNC-002)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productId": "SKU-001", "quantity": 0 } ] }

### 422 - product not in the catalog (ADR-0014)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productId": "SKU-999", "quantity": 1 } ] }

### 404 - unknown order
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
